msgstr "本节说明相关操作和结果。 ``chr7:55,205,615-55,205,617``"

#: ../../sequence.rst:79 ../../sequence.rst:80 ../../sequence.rst:197
msgid "``TGA``"
msgstr "本节说明相关操作和结果。 ``TGA``"

#: ../../sequence.rst:81 ../../sequence.rst:86
msgid "ACTB / −"
msgstr "ACTB / −"

#: ../../sequence.rst:83
msgid "``chr7:5,529,655-5,529,657``"
msgstr "本节说明相关操作和结果。 ``chr7:5,529,655-5,529,657``"

#: ../../sequence.rst:84
msgid "``CAT``"
msgstr "本节说明相关操作和结果。 ``CAT``"

#: ../../sequence.rst:88
msgid "``chr7:5,527,748-5,527,750``"
msgstr "本节说明相关操作和结果。 ``chr7:5,527,748-5,527,750``"

#: ../../sequence.rst:89
msgid "``CTA``"
msgstr "本节说明相关操作和结果。 ``CTA``"

#: ../../sequence.rst:90
msgid "``TAG``"
msgstr "本节说明相关操作和结果。 ``TAG``"

#: ../../sequence.rst:93
msgid "Positive-strand example: EGFR"
msgstr "正链示例：EGFR"

#: ../../sequence.rst:95
msgid "Keep **Flip strand off** for the imported FASTA."
msgstr "对导入的 FASTA 保持  Flip strand off 。"

#: ../../sequence.rst:96
msgid ""
"Paste ``chr7:55,019,250-55,019,308`` into the search box. The start "
"triplet at 55,019,278–55,019,280 is **ATG**, read left to right in the "
"coding direction."
msgstr "粘贴  ``chr7:55,019,250-55,019,308``  ATG "

#: ../../sequence.rst:98
msgid "With Aa on, find the frame containing that triplet. It shows green **M**."
msgstr "开启 Aa 后，找到包含该三联体的阅读框。该位置显示绿色 M。"

#: ../../sequence.rst:99
msgid ""
"Paste ``chr7:55,205,587-55,205,645`` to inspect the selected transcript's"
" terminal **TGA**. In Standard table #1 it is a red **\\***, not an amino"
" acid."
msgstr "粘贴  ``chr7:55,205,587-55,205,645``  TGA   \\ "

#: ../../sequence.rst:102
msgid ""
"EGFR terminal TGA in the imported local FASTA and standard-code "
"translation"
msgstr "本节说明相关操作和结果。"

#: ../../sequence.rst:106
msgid ""
"EGFR stop region. Read the positive-strand DNA left to right. A stop "
"symbol is meaningful for the selected CDS only in the correct reading "
"frame."
msgstr "本节说明相关操作和结果。"

#: ../../sequence.rst:110
msgid "Negative-strand example: ACTB and Flip strand"
msgstr "负链示例：ACTB 与 Flip strand"

#: ../../sequence.rst:112
msgid ""
"Paste ``chr7:5,529,627-5,529,685``. With flip off, the reference + strand"
" at the start boundary reads **CAT** from left to right."
msgstr "粘贴  ``chr7:5,529,627-5,529,685``  CAT "

#: ../../sequence.rst:114
msgid ""
"Click the **double-arrow (Flip strand)** beside the imported FASTA. The "
"displayed letters become the complementary bases at the same coordinates:"
" **CAT → GTA** when read left to right."
msgstr ""
"点击导入 FASTA 旁的  双箭头（Flip strand） 以显示互补碱基。  double-arrow (Flip strand)   "
"CAT → GTA "

#: ../../sequence.rst:117
msgid ""
"Coordinates still increase left to right. The negative coding strand runs"
" **5′→3′ from right to left**, so that displayed GTA is read as **ATG**. "
"The flipped translation uses the reverse-complement triplet and shows M."
msgstr "坐标仍从左向右递增；负向编码链沿  5′→3′ 从右向左 。  5′→3′ from right to left   ATG "

#: ../../sequence.rst:120
msgid ""
"Paste ``chr7:5,527,720-5,527,778`` for the stop. The reference reads "
"**CTA**; flip displays **GAT** from left to right, which reads **TAG** "
"right to left."
msgstr "粘贴  ``chr7:5,527,720-5,527,778``  CTA   GAT   TAG "

#: ../../sequence.rst:122
msgid ""
"Click the double-arrow again to restore the reference strand. The gene's "
"annotated − strand, its exon positions and the coordinate ruler never "
"change."
msgstr "再次点击双箭头以恢复参考链。"

#: ../../sequence.rst:125
msgid "ACTB start boundary before flip showing reference positive-strand CAT"
msgstr "本节说明相关操作和结果。"

#: ../../sequence.rst:129
msgid ""
"Before flip: ACTB is a negative-strand gene, but the FASTA row still "
"shows reference + strand bases. CAT is therefore expected at its start "
"boundary."
msgstr "翻转前，FASTA 行显示参考 + 链碱基。"

#: ../../sequence.rst:132
msgid ""
"Same ACTB start window after flip with complementary bases and reverse-"
"direction translation"
msgstr "本节说明相关操作和结果。"

#: ../../sequence.rst:136
msgid ""
"After flip, in exactly the same window: read the complementary row from "
"right to left for the ACTB coding sequence. The coordinate axis is not "
"reversed."
msgstr "翻转后，从右向左读取互补行得到编码序列；坐标轴不会反转。"

#: ../../sequence.rst:139
msgid ""
"ACTB stop boundary on the complementary strand with standard-code stop "
"marker"
msgstr "本节说明相关操作和结果。"

#: ../../sequence.rst:143
msgid ""
"ACTB stop boundary after flip. Right-to-left TAG is a stop in Standard "
"#1. The start is at the higher-coordinate end of this negative-strand "
"CDS."
msgstr "本节说明相关操作和结果。"

#: ../../sequence.rst:148
msgid ""
"Flip strand is not a gene-strand editor and does not reverse the screen. "
"It complements bases in place. Do not copy the left-to-right letters of a"
" flipped negative-strand row and label them a 5′→3′ coding sequence "
"without reversing their order."
msgstr "Flip strand 只在原位互补碱基，不会反转屏幕或编辑基因链。"

#: ../../sequence.rst:154
msgid "Translation tables and reading frames"
msgstr "翻译表与阅读框"

#: ../../sequence.rst:156
msgid ""
"Click **Aa** beside the sequence row to open the translation panel. "
"Enable **Show translation**, then choose a genetic code. For human "
"nuclear EGFR and ACTB use **#1 Standard**; for a vertebrate mitochondrial"
" example choose **#2 Vertebrate mitochondrial** only when that code is "
"appropriate."
msgstr ""
"点击序列轨道旁的  Aa ，启用  Show translation 。  #1 Standard   #2 Vertebrate "
"mitochondrial "

#: ../../sequence.rst:161
msgid ""
"Aa translation panel showing the enabled translation switch and genetic-"
"code selector"
msgstr "本节说明相关操作和结果。"

#: ../../sequence.rst:165
msgid ""
"The actual translation controls. The selector contains multiple numbered "
"genetic codes; the code is selected per imported track. Flipping that "
"track also changes the strand used for its three-frame translation."
msgstr "实际的翻译控件；每条导入轨道单独选择遗传密码。"

#: ../../sequence.rst:169
msgid ""
"Three rows represent three offsets of the genomic reading frame, not "
"three transcript isoforms. Frame grouping is anchored to genome "
"coordinates."
msgstr "三行表示基因组阅读框的三个偏移，而不是三个转录本异构体。"

#: ../../sequence.rst:171
msgid ""
"A green **M** marks ATG; red **\\*** marks a stop under the chosen code. "
"Other letters are amino-acid one-letter symbols. The DNA row remains "
"A/C/G/T."
msgstr "绿色 M 表示 ATG；红色星号表示在所选密码表中为终止密码子。其它字母为氨基酸单字母符号，DNA 行仍显示 A/C/G/T。"

#: ../../sequence.rst:173
msgid ""
"All three frames can contain incidental ATG and stop triplets. Confirm "
"the annotated CDS and transcript before calling a biological start or "
"stop."
msgstr "三个阅读框都可能包含偶然的 ATG 和终止三联体，请先确认 CDS 和转录本。"

#: ../../sequence.rst:175
msgid ""
"Genomic-window translation does not splice exons, infer a transcript's "
"phase, or produce a complete mature protein. Introns and exon junctions "
"require transcript-aware interpretation; a short codon may even straddle "
"an exon junction."
msgstr "基因组窗口翻译不会剪接外显子或生成完整成熟蛋白。"

#: ../../sequence.rst:178
msgid ""
"The viewer highlights ATG specifically. It is not a comprehensive "
"predictor of alternative initiation sites, even when another code permits"
" them."
msgstr "查看器会突出显示 ATG，但不是全面的替代起始位点预测工具。"

#: ../../sequence.rst:181
msgid ""
"Complete standard DNA genetic-code table grouping all 64 codons by the "
"first two bases"
msgstr "本节说明相关操作和结果。"

#: ../../sequence.rst:185
msgid ""
"Standard genetic code (#1), DNA alphabet. Every row lists the third base "
"in T/C/A/G order. M is methionine, W is tryptophan, and * is a stop. The "
"companion contrast highlights why the same DNA can translate differently "
"after changing the code table."
msgstr "标准遗传密码（#1）使用 DNA 字母表，M 为甲硫氨酸，W 为色氨酸，* 为终止。"

#: ../../sequence.rst:190
msgid "Selected differences between codes #1 and #2"
msgstr "代码 #1 与 #2 的选定差异"

#: ../../sequence.rst:194
msgid "DNA codon"
msgstr "DNA 密码子"

#: ../../sequence.rst:195
msgid "#1 Standard"
msgstr "#1 Standard"

#: ../../sequence.rst:196
msgid "#2 Vertebrate mitochondrial"
msgstr "本节说明相关操作和结果。"

#: ../../sequence.rst:198
msgid "Stop (*), red"
msgstr "Stop (*), red"

#: ../../sequence.rst:199
msgid "Tryptophan (W)"
msgstr "Tryptophan (W)"

#: ../../sequence.rst:200
msgid "``ATA``"
msgstr "本节说明相关操作和结果。 ``ATA``"

#: ../../sequence.rst:201
msgid "Isoleucine (I)"
msgstr "Isoleucine (I)"

#: ../../sequence.rst:202
msgid "Methionine (M)"
msgstr "Methionine (M)"

#: ../../sequence.rst:203
msgid "``AGA`` / ``AGG``"
msgstr "本节说明相关操作和结果。 ``AGA`` ``AGG``"

#: ../../sequence.rst:204
msgid "Arginine (R)"
msgstr "Arginine (R)"

#: ../../sequence.rst:205
msgid "Stop (*) in this table"
msgstr "Stop (*) in this table"

#: ../../sequence.rst:207
msgid "Standard genetic code showing TGA as a stop at the verified EGFR boundary"
msgstr "标准遗传密码（#1）使用 DNA 字母表，M 为甲硫氨酸，W 为色氨酸，* 为终止。"

#: ../../sequence.rst:211
msgid "Table #1: TGA is a stop. This is the appropriate code for nuclear EGFR."
msgstr "表 #1：TGA 是终止密码子，适用于核基因 EGFR。"

#: ../../sequence.rst:213
msgid "Identical genomic bases with code two showing TGA as tryptophan"
msgstr "本节说明相关操作和结果。"

#: ../../sequence.rst:217
msgid ""
"Same DNA and coordinates, temporarily switched to table #2: TGA becomes "
"W. This comparison demonstrates the software setting only; it is not a "
"valid mitochondrial reassignment of a nuclear EGFR gene."
msgstr "相同 DNA 和坐标切换到表 #2 后 TGA 变为 W，仅用于演示软件设置。"

#: ../../sequence.rst:222
msgid "Troubleshooting the sequence view"
msgstr "序列视图故障排查"

#: ../../sequence.rst:224
msgid ""
"If the track says to zoom in, enter one of the narrow windows above. If "
"it has no sequence, check its visibility, FASTA chromosome header and "
"assembly. If an expected ATG appears as CAT, check the gene strand and "
"flip state before assuming a variant. If the amino-acid row is absent, "
"enable Aa for that exact track and zoom further. A discrepancy after "
"these checks can reflect an assembly/transcript mismatch; do not fix it "
"by choosing a different genetic code."
msgstr "若轨道提示放大，请输入窄窗口；若无序列，请检查可见性、FASTA 标题和装配。"

